title: SquidQuestComplete
tags: quests
---
<<if $Squidquest_status == "started">>
Squid: Have you brought me that yogurt?
-> Slimes: Yeah, we got them right here Squid!
    <<if $Squidquest_amount < $Squidquest_count>>
        Squid: This isn't enough I'm going to need at least {$Squidquest_amount} yogurt to please my wife!
    <<elseif $Squidquest_amount == $Squidquest_count>>
        <<set $Squidquest_status = "completed">>
        Squid: Thanks for all the Yogurt, I'll make sure my wife gets it!
        Squid: Here's a key for your troubles
        <<give_reward QuestGiverSquid>>
    <<endif>>
-> Slimes: Not yet, were still missing some
    Squid: Come back when you've got all the yogurt!
<<elseif $Squidquest_status == "completed">>
    Squid: thanks for helping me with those yogurt!
<<else>>
    Squid: You already knew I needed all that yogurt! My wife is going to be so happy!
    Squid: Here's a key for your troubles
    <<give_reward QuestGiverSquid>>
<<endif>>
===
